            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bob is a narcoleptic sleepwalker. The city wants to swallow him whole. You are the only part of his mind still awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/52c08ba131f906f1d8a38fab6843800e.poster.avif?t=1782146763\" width=616 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/52c08ba131f906f1d8a38fab6843800e.webm?t=1782146763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Bed is an atmospheric isometric puzzle game set inside a surreal, hand-painted dreamscape. As Subob, Bob's subconscious guardian, you manipulate the strange and impossible world around him to carve a safe path back to bed. Redirect his steps, outwit the hazards, and navigate physics-defying environments where streets fold, staircases loop, and nothing behaves as it should.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/fff4add2ba17903b69bff3eb5e784e8a.poster.avif?t=1782146763\" width=624 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/fff4add2ba17903b69bff3eb5e784e8a.webm?t=1782146763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURREAL HAND-PAINTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play inside a living work of art. Every level is a meticulously crafted dreamscape blending urban architecture with impossible, otherworldly imagery inspired by surrealist painting.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIND-BENDING ISOMETRIC PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate 3D environments that defy the laws of physics. Manipulate oversized objects and exploit the architecture itself to guide Bob safely through each level.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO CHARACTERS, ONE MIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subob is not separate from Bob. He is the part of him that refuses to sleep. This quiet, wordless relationship is at the heart of everything.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bob is a narcoleptic sleepwalker. The city wants to swallow him whole. You are the only part of his mind still awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/52c08ba131f906f1d8a38fab6843800e.poster.avif?t=1782146763\" width=616 height=129 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/52c08ba131f906f1d8a38fab6843800e.webm?t=1782146763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to Bed is an atmospheric isometric puzzle game set inside a surreal, hand-painted dreamscape. As Subob, Bob's subconscious guardian, you manipulate the strange and impossible world around him to carve a safe path back to bed. Redirect his steps, outwit the hazards, and navigate physics-defying environments where streets fold, staircases loop, and nothing behaves as it should.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/fff4add2ba17903b69bff3eb5e784e8a.poster.avif?t=1782146763\" width=624 height=185 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/308040/extras/fff4add2ba17903b69bff3eb5e784e8a.webm?t=1782146763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURREAL HAND-PAINTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play inside a living work of art. Every level is a meticulously crafted dreamscape blending urban architecture with impossible, otherworldly imagery inspired by surrealist painting.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MIND-BENDING ISOMETRIC PUZZLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate 3D environments that defy the laws of physics. Manipulate oversized objects and exploit the architecture itself to guide Bob safely through each level.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TWO CHARACTERS, ONE MIND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subob is not separate from Bob. He is the part of him that refuses to sleep. This quiet, wordless relationship is at the heart of everything.</strong></p>",
